OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fdry and bright weather to end the day,
OL,7,Fwith a low risk of an isolated shower
OL,8,Ffurther west under some patchy cloud.
OL,9,FHowever, cloud will increase from the
OL,10,Fnorthwest later, giving the odd shower
OL,11,Flater. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FThursday will start rather
OL,14,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,15,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,16,Fleaving a mostly fine afternoon.
OL,17,FFeeling much fresher in gentle
OL,18,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
